{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00480",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.37,
      "end_seconds": 4.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Good morning. I hope the wait wasn't too long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.18,
      "end_seconds": 5.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Hi."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.23,
      "end_seconds": 12.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Did you find the place alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.93,
      "end_seconds": 18.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Yes, it was easy enough. The parking was the hard part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.14,
      "end_seconds": 21.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Go ahead, tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.11,
      "end_seconds": 33.85,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "I've been passing out once last week. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.36,
      "end_seconds": 38.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "So, how long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.73,
      "end_seconds": 41.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Well, it's been three days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.66,
      "end_seconds": 45.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Okay, I'm following. How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.45,
      "end_seconds": 52.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.29,
      "end_seconds": 56.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Have you had any tongue biting or confusion afterwards?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.24,
      "end_seconds": 61.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Oh, I haven't had tongue biting or confusion afterwards, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.06,
      "end_seconds": 79.99,
      "duration_seconds": 16.93,
      "text": "Let me explain how I'm thinking about this. When someone has symptoms like these, we first look for the common and treatable causes, and only then for the rarer ones. That's why I'm going step by step rather than ordering everything at once."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.98,
      "end_seconds": 83.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "I mean, okay, that makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.37,
      "end_seconds": 89.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.81,
      "end_seconds": 96.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for five years. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.57,
      "end_seconds": 104.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.64,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.49,
      "end_seconds": 108.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Ramipril. I take it 5 milligrams, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.92,
      "end_seconds": 110.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Right, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.71,
      "end_seconds": 113.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.08,
      "end_seconds": 127.97,
      "duration_seconds": 13.89,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.46,
      "end_seconds": 131.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.24,
      "end_seconds": 134.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.47,
      "end_seconds": 138.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.43,
      "end_seconds": 141.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.24,
      "end_seconds": 144.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.17,
      "end_seconds": 147.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.56,
      "end_seconds": 150.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "I smoke, yes, around five a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.08,
      "end_seconds": 152.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.6,
      "end_seconds": 155.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.45,
      "end_seconds": 161.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.4,
      "end_seconds": 172.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.83,
      "end_seconds": 177.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.07,
      "end_seconds": 188.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.53,
      "end_seconds": 215.02,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 79, SpO2 97 percent on room air, temp 36.4 degrees. And respiratory rate 17, BP is 111 over 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.52,
      "end_seconds": 218.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.34,
      "end_seconds": 225.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment. I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.6,
      "end_seconds": 228.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.37,
      "end_seconds": 244.17,
      "duration_seconds": 13.8,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.12,
      "end_seconds": 246.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.78,
      "end_seconds": 270.34,
      "duration_seconds": 22.56,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression from what you've said is this: This looks most like a simple faint, probably reflex-related. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been passing out once last week for three days, and no tongue biting or confusion afterwards."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.47,
      "end_seconds": 272.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.31,
      "end_seconds": 282.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "Let's get blood tests, for syncope. Drink enough water and avoid standing still for long stretches, and sit if you feel it coming."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.0,
      "end_seconds": 299.69,
      "duration_seconds": 16.69,
      "text": "Right. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you pass out again, especially with chest pain or palpitations. Let's review you after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.89,
      "end_seconds": 302.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.67,
      "end_seconds": 308.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.36,
      "end_seconds": 314.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.71,
      "end_seconds": 320.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.86,
      "end_seconds": 324.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}